hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"858","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba se riwayat hai ke un ke walid ne Umar bin Abdullah bin Arqam Zuhri ko khat likha jis mein unhein hukm diya ke wo Subaia bint Haris Aslamiya ke paas dakhil hon aur un se un ki hadees aur us ke baaray mein poochein jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se kaha tha jab unhon ne Aap se fatwa manga tha. To Umar bin Abdullah ne Abdullah bin Utba ko khat likha aur unhein khabar di ke Subaia ne unhein bataya ke wo Sa'd bin Khaula ke nikah mein thin jo Banu Amir bin Luay mein thay aur un mein se thay jinhon ne Badr mein shirkat ki thi. To wo Hajjat-ul-Wida mein un se faut ho gaye jabke wo hamila thin. To un ki wafaat ke baad jald unhon ne hamal janam diya. Phir jab wo nifas se niklin to khastgaron ke liye ban sanwar kar tayyar huin. To un ke paas Abus Sanabil bin Bakak aaye jo Banu Abduddar mein se aik mard thay. To unhon ne un se kaha: Mujhe kya hai ke main tumhein bani sanwari dekhta hun, shayad tum nikah ki ummeed rakhti ho. Beshak Allah ki qasam tum nikah nahi karo gi yahan tak ke tum par chaar maheena das din guzrein. Subaia ne kaha: Phir jab unhon ne mujh se ye kaha to main ne shaam ko apne kapray sametay aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap se is ke baaray mein poocha. To Aap ne mujhe fatwa diya ke main halal ho gayi hun jab main ne hamal janam diya aur mujhe hukm diya ke agar mera ji chahay to nikah karun. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: To main koi haraj nahi samajhta ke wo nikah karay jab wo (hamal) janam de chahe wo khoon mein ho, siwae is ke ke us ka shohar us se qurb na karay yahan tak ke wo paak ho jaye. (Muslim: 4/201). Baab: Talaq wali (aurat) ka apni khajoor kaatnay ke liye nikalna. (Taalat se murad nifas se nikal kar salamat hona hai; Muslim mein fala hai.)"
"859","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Meri khala ko talaq di gayi to unhon ne apni khajoor kaatnay ka irada kiya. To aik mard ne unhein nikalnay se roka. To wo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayin. To Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi, apni khajoor kaato, beshak tum sadqa karo gi ya neki karo gi. (Muslim: 4/200). (Jadad khajoor kaatnay ko kehtay hain.)"
"860","[AI-translation] Fatima bint Qais se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mere shohar ne mujhe teen talaqein de din aur mujhe khauf hai ke mujh par (koi) hamla kar de ga. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne usay hukm diya to wo muntaqil ho gayeen. (Muslim: 4/200)"
"861","[AI-translation] Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat hai ke unhein Fatima bint Qais ne bataya ke wo Abu Amr bin Hafs bin Mughira ke nikah mein thin. To us ne unhein aakhri teen talaqein de din. Unhon ne daawa kiya ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas apne ghar se nikalnay ke baaray mein fatwa poochnay aayin. To Aap ne unhein hukm diya ke wo nabina Ibn Umm Maktoom ke paas muntaqil ho jayein. To Marwan ne usay tasleem karnay se inkar kiya ke talaq wali apne ghar se niklay. Aur Urwa ne kaha: Beshak Aisha ne Fatima bint Qais par is ka inkar kiya. (Muslim: 4/196-197). Baab: Talaq wali ka iddat ke baad nikah karna. (Murad us ki khabar ko sach man-nay se inkar hai.)"
"862","[AI-translation] Fatima bint Qais (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke un ke shohar ne unhein teen talaqein de din. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ke liye na rehaish muqarrar ki aur na kharcha. Unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum halal ho jao to mujhe ittela dena. To main ne Aap ko ittela di. To unhein Muawiya, Abu Jahm aur Usama bin Zaid ne paigham bheja. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Raha Muawiya to faqeer mard hai, aur raha Abu Jahm to auraton ko bohat maarnay wala mard hai, lekin Usama bin Zaid (behtar hai). To unhon ne apne haath se yun kaha: Usama, Usama. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Allah ki itaat aur Us ke Rasool ki itaat tumharay liye behtar hai. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne us se shaadi ki aur khush hui. (Muslim: 4/199). Baab: Maiyyat ki iddat mein sog aur surma chhorna. (Tarib se murad faqeer hai; unhon ne na-pasandeedgi ki wajah se aisa kaha kyunke wo Quraishi thin aur wo ghulamon mein se thay.)"
"863","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Nafi se, Zainab bint Abu Salama se riwayat hai ke unhon ne unhein ye teen ahadees bayan keen. Unhon ne kaha: Zainab ne kaha: Main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Umm Habiba ke paas dakhil hui jab un ke walid Abu Sufyan faut ho gaye. To Umm Habiba ne zard khushbu, khalook ya us ke siwa, mangwai. To unhon ne us mein se londi ko lagaya phir apne chehray ke kinaron ko chhua. Phir unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Mujhe khushbu ki koi haajat nahi siwae is ke ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko mimbar par farmatay hue suna: Kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti hai halal nahi ke wo maiyyat par teen se zyada sog karay siwae shohar par chaar maheena das din. Zainab ne kaha: Phir main (doosri aur teesri hadees ke liye dakhil hui; Arabi ibarat yahan kati hui hai). (Muslim). (Khalook makhloot khushbu hai; aarizain chehray ke donon kinaray hain.)"
"864","[AI-translation] Umm Atiya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi aurat maiyyat par teen se zyada sog na karay siwae shohar par chaar maheena das din. Aur na ranga hua kapra pehnay siwae asb ke kapray ke, aur na surma lagaye aur na khushbu lagaye siwae is ke ke jab paak ho to qist ya azfaar ki thori miqdar (dhuni le). (Muslim: 4/204). (Asb Yemen ki chadarein hain; nubza se murad thora tukra hai; qist aur azfaar dhuni ki do qisamein hain jo khushbu ke liye nahi balke naagawar boo door karnay ke liye hain.)"
